lass="btn">{{buttonText}}</a></div><div class="footer"><strong>{{companyName}}</strong><br>{{companyAddress}}<br>{{currentYear}}</div></div></div></body></html>', 'Preset sombre a contraste fort pour messages premium ou techniques.', FALSE, NOW(), NOW()
